tel announces its grain levy.","conflict":"The levy would strip the isle's stores, and Cartel enforcers are already watching the legal shipping routes.","outcome":"Maris decides to smuggle grain through unmapped service corridors, putting her on the Cartel's radar.","summary":"Maris learns of the grain levy and begins planning a secret grain run through her hidden paths."},{"id":"scn_veya_warns_wardens","title":"A Warning at the Forge","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Veya wants the Bridge Wardens at Emberroost to reinforce the failing cloudstone cables.","conflict":"The Wardens are short of supplies and resent unproven claims, and Veya cannot bear to concede that her data has gaps.","outcome":"The Wardens grudgingly agree to inspect one bridge, but warn that supplies are short and the Cartel controls the shipping.","summary":"Veya presents her findings at the forge-island, and the Wardens hesitantly agree to test her warning.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_survey"]}]},{"id":"act_the_toll_war_ignites","title":"The Toll War Ignites","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_cartel_buries_charts","title":"An Offer Veya Cannot Take","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to buy or bury Veya's new charts, and Veya wants safe passage and wind-debt relief to continue her work.","conflict":"Their shared past as apprentices makes the offer personal, and Veya refuses to let Kael control her work.","outcome":"Veya refuses, and Kael privately vows to stop her while still admiring her skill.","summary":"Kael charms and pressures Veya at the docks, and she walks away with her charts and a new enemy.","depends_on":["scn_mistral_ledgers","scn_veya_warns_wardens"]},{"id":"scn_forge_sabotage","title":"The Severed Supply","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"The Wardens want to braid replacement cables, while Kael's agents want to keep supplies from reaching the forge.","conflict":"Supply barges are held at Mistral Docks, and Veya must keep the forge lit within the shielded pits without risking a spark aloft.","outcome":"The Wardens publicly accuse Kael of sabotage and the Toll War erupts openly.","summary":"Supply shortages at Emberroost reveal Cartel interference, and the Wardens and Cartel openly clash.","depends_on":["scn_cartel_buries_charts"]},{"id":"scn_maris_meets_veya","title":"Paths Between Windmills","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to learn Maris's hidden service corridors, and Maris wants help keeping her smuggling routes safe.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and suspects Veya's motives, and Veya's pride makes it hard to ask for help.","outcome":"They agree to trade wind-current knowledge for secret paths, forming an alliance.","summary":"Veya travels to The Hollow and trades her wind-sight for Maris's unmapped corridors.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_levy_notice","scn_cartel_buries_charts"]},{"id":"scn_enforcers_close_in","title":"Enforcers on the Granary Lanes","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to catch the smuggler undermining the grain levy, and Maris wants to deliver grain to the isle.","conflict":"Cartel enforcers close in on her routes, and Maris must choose between hiding home and protecting Veya.","outcome":"Maris barely escapes with part of the grain, and Kael learns that Veya is her ally.","summary":"Cartel enforcers nearly corner Maris, and Kael connects her to Veya's work.","depends_on":["scn_maris_meets_veya"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_betrayal","title":"The Charts Go Missing","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to complete her route map, and Kael wants to steal or suppress it.","conflict":"Veya will not admit that her first calculation was wrong, which leaves a flaw that Kael exploits.","outcome":"Kael takes an incomplete chart, and Veya realises she must share her work with others to finish it.","summary":"Kael exploits a mistake in Veya's chart at the academy and takes a copy, shaking her certainty.","depends_on":["scn_enforcers_close_in","scn_forge_sabotage"]},{"id":"scn_veya_admits_error","title":"Admitting the Error","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to correct her chart before the stolen copy leads travellers into danger.","conflict":"Admitting her mistake threatens her pride, and Maris's loyalty to home is tested when she must help.","outcome":"Veya admits her error, and Maris contributes corridor knowledge to correct the route.","summary":"Veya concedes her mistake and rebuilds the route with Maris's help.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_betrayal"]},{"id":"scn_wardens_rally","title":"The Wardens Rally","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Maris want the Wardens and the Hollow Circle to share resources and test the corrected route.","conflict":"The factions distrust each other, and wind-debts strain every promise.","outcome":"The Wardens and the Hollow Circle agree to a joint crossing, which will force a confrontation with the Cartel.","summary":"Veya and Maris unite the Wardens and Hollow Circle behind the corrected route.","depends_on":["scn_veya_admits_error"]}]},{"id":"act_the_last_crossing","title":"The Last Crossing","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_stolen_chart_trap","title":"The Stolen Chart's Trap","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants to seize the last stable routes using the stolen chart, while Veya and Maris want to lead the joint crossing safely.","conflict":"Kael's convoy follows the flawed chart onto a failing skybridge, and Veya and Maris must decide whether to warn him.","outcome":"Veya and Maris warn Kael and guide his convoy back, which forces him to see the cost of his control.","summary":"At the docks, the flawed chart leads Kael's convoy toward collapse, and Veya and Maris choose to save it.","depends_on":["scn_wardens_rally","scn_silverspine_betrayal"]},{"id":"scn_bridge_confrontation","title":"The Confrontation on the Skybridge","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to share the corrected charts openly, and Kael must decide whether to seize them or accept shared routes.","conflict":"Kael's ambition and his admiration for Veya clash, while a failing bridge threatens everyone present.","outcome":"Kael lets the charts be published and the Cartel loses its monopoly on the stable routes.","summary":"Kael chooses to let Veya's charts be shared instead of seizing them, ending the Toll War's worst fighting.","depends_on":["scn_stolen_chart_trap"]}]},{"id":"act_after_the_toll_war","title":"After the Toll War","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_new_accord","title":"The New Accord","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael and Veya want to settle tolls and wind-debts so that the routes stay open to everyone.","conflict":"Cartel merchants resist losing profit and Kael must give up some control.","outcome":"A toll accord is agreed, with Cartel revenue tied to bridge maintenance.","summary":"Kael negotiates a new toll accord that funds the Wardens and protects the routes.","depends_on":["scn_bridge_confrontation"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"A Fed Archipelago","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Maris wants the grain levy lifted, and Kael wants to honour the accord.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to forgive the Cartel, and Kael must earn trust.","outcome":"The levy is reduced and Maris accepts that hiding and standing firm can both be brave.","summary":"The grain levy is eased, and Maris sees her isle secure.","depends_on":["scn_new_accord"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_atlas","title":"The Shared Atlas","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to publish the shared atlas of safe skybridge routes in her mentor's name.","conflict":"She must credit those who helped and give up sole recognition.","outcome":"The atlas is published with every contributor named, and Veya embraces sharing truth over hoarding it.","summary":"Veya, Maris and Kael publish the atlas at Silverspine, closing the story with shared credit and safer bridges.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_harvest","scn_new_accord"]}]}]}
