rol.","summary":"At the docks, the flawed chart leads Kael's convoy toward collapse, and Veya and Maris choose to save it.","depends_on":["scn_wardens_rally","scn_silverspine_betrayal"]},{"id":"scn_bridge_confrontation","title":"The Confrontation on the Skybridge","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to share the corrected charts openly, and Kael must decide whether to seize them or accept shared routes.","conflict":"Kael's ambition and his admiration for Veya clash, while a failing bridge threatens everyone present.","outcome":"Kael lets the charts be published and the Cartel loses its monopoly on the stable routes.","summary":"Kael chooses to let Veya's charts be shared instead of seizing them, ending the Toll War's worst fighting.","depends_on":["scn_stolen_chart_trap"]}]},{"id":"act_after_the_toll_war","title":"After the Toll War","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_new_accord","title":"The New Accord","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael and Veya want to settle tolls and wind-debts so that the routes stay open to everyone.","conflict":"Cartel merchants resist losing profit and Kael must give up some control.","outcome":"A toll accord is agreed, with Cartel revenue tied to bridge maintenance.","summary":"Kael negotiates a new toll accord that funds the Wardens and protects the routes.","depends_on":["scn_bridge_confrontation"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"A Fed Archipelago","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Maris wants the grain levy lifted, and Kael wants to honour the accord.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to forgive the Cartel, and Kael must earn trust.","outcome":"The levy is reduced and Maris accepts that hiding and standing firm can both be brave.","summary":"The grain levy is eased, and Maris sees her isle secure.","depends_on":["scn_new_accord"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_atlas",