fused to acknowledge.","outcome":"The charts are suppressed and Veya is discredited, forcing her to see she was wrong to hoard them.","summary":"The Cartel buries her charts and exposes a flaw she had refused to admit.","depends_on":["scn_mistral_ledger"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Last Crossing","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_emberroost_stand","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to share her corrected charts with the Wardens; Kael wants to seize the last stable routes before the bridges fail.","conflict":"Kael confronts them at the forge-island, Maris must choose between hiding and standing with Veya, and any open flame risks severing a bridge.","outcome":"Veya shares the charts openly and Maris stands beside her, exposing Kael's sabotage and breaking his hold on the routes.","summary":"The three meet at the forge-island, where shared truth defeats Kael's attempt at control.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_burial","scn_mistral_ledger"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Shared Routes","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_mistral_reckoning","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Salvage the Cartel's position after losing the routes.","conflict":"He admires Veya's skill yet must weigh the cost of control against its gains.","outcome":"Kael relinquishes the monopoly over the stable routes and accepts a shared arrangement.","summary":"Kael reckons with the cost of control as the Cartel's grip loosens.","depends_on":["scn_emberroost_stand"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Maris wants to secure The Hollow's grain; Veya wants the charts distributed to all.","conflict":"Maris must decide whether to forgive and trust Veya while the isle's wind-debts remain unpaid.","outcome":"Maris accepts that hiding can be brave and keeps the new routes open, and Veya's charts reach every isle.","summary":"The Hollow is fed and the charts are shared, sealing the friendship.","depends_on":["scn_mistral_reckoning"]}]}]}

